cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas Neuroteca, cítala así. / If you use Neuroteca, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Neuroteca: atlas vivo del sistema nervioso"
abstract: >-
  Atlas interactivo de neuroanatomía y neurofisiología juntas, de acceso libre, pensado para
  estudiantes de medicina, neurociencia y psicología sin asumir formación previa. Cada estructura
  declara su nivel de detalle, sus fuentes y su estado de revisión. /
  Open-access interactive atlas that presents neuroanatomy and neurophysiology together, for
  students of medicine, neuroscience and psychology, with no prior background assumed. Every
  structure declares its level of detail, its sources and its review status.
authors:
  - family-names: "Alamilla Rodríguez"
    given-names: "Maximiliano"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7890-4569"
repository-code: "https://github.com/neuroteca/neuroteca.github.io"
url: "https://neuroteca.github.io"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/neuroteca/neuroteca.github.io/blob/main/LICENSE"
keywords:
  - neuroanatomía
  - neurofisiología
  - atlas
  - educación médica
  - neuroanatomy
  - neurophysiology
  - open educational resource
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-31"
